# …but the dev-portal matrix docs ARE deliverables (tracked-status ledger +
# generated catalogue render) — force-track them (last match wins).
!tests/dev-portal/UNVERIFIED.md
!tests/dev-portal/cross-tenant-catalog.md
# …and the repo's own onboarding docs must ship with it (found 2026-09-04:
# both were silently caught by the blanket *.md rule above and had never
# actually been committed — a clone got no README at all).
!/README.md
!/MIGRATION.md

# ── Local-only docs/evidence (2026-09-03) ──────────────────────────────────────
# Everything that isn't test code/helpers/fixtures/config — investigation
# write-ups, filed-bug progress notes, raw network-capture evidence bundles,
# stray root notes — lives here so the repo stays clean for handoff to other
# QA. Safe to delete this whole folder at any time; nothing under `tests/`,
# `pages/`, `fixtures/`, `helpers/` reads from it, and any spec that WRITES
# evidence here (matrix specs, `_evidence.ts`) recreates it on its own.
local-only/

